sequenceDiagram
  participant Pipe as AuthorityPipelineStagesExecutor
  participant Art as Artifact synthesis stage
  participant Syn as ArchLucid.ArtifactSynthesis
  participant Orch as AuthorityRunOrchestrator
  participant SQL as Tenant SQL catalog
  participant Out as Retrieval / integration outboxes
  Note over Pipe,Art: OTel span authority.artifacts<br/>then FinalizeCommittedPipelineAsync

  Pipe->>Art: Run after decisioning
  Art->>Syn: Build package slices / artifact payloads
  Syn->>SQL: Stage artifact rows (pre-commit)
  Art-->>Pipe: Stages complete
  Pipe->>Orch: FinalizeCommittedPipelineAsync
  Orch->>SQL: Commit golden manifest + decision trace
  Orch->>Out: Enlist retrieval indexing + integration-event outboxes
  Orch-->>Pipe: Authority-complete run
